        "definition": "**TREEIFY_THRESHOLD (8) and UNTREEIFY_THRESHOLD (6) Constants in HashMap** defines the hash table architecture in java.util.HashMap that maps keys to values with amortized O(1) performance using array buckets and Red-Black tree conversion.",
